# Maibaum top (goal): spruce Wipfel g/G/j on top of the peeled pole, the
# green wreath y/g/G, red-white ribbons r/R and w/i hanging from it, and the
# Wurstkranz = a chain of sausages E/n hanging in front of the pole.
# Sits on top of maibaum_pole (pole cols 13..18 here = cols 5..10 there,
# same bark-ring phase, so the seam is invisible). idle = ribbons flutter.
sprite = maibaum_top
size   = 32x48
origin = 16,48
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=20 loop
